A balance assignment validates its resolved reduction.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Holdings
account Bank
account Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 100 USD
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Holdings  2 FUND {100 USD}
  Bank  -200 USD

2024-01-02 Reduce holdings
  Holdings  = 1 FUND
  Opening

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Negative FUND posting must use both a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}) and a transaction price (@ or @@); the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:15:3

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Positive FUND posting must use a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}); the default commodity is USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:16:3
